          "id": "13567",
          "body": "Hi \n@Tim Lavelle\n  — the latest draft is for your review and approval. \n\n\n\n\nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/wiki/x/BoCrF\n \n\n\n\n\nA few items still need your steer:\nHandoff Boundary table\n — still marked \"[FOR UPDATE],\" per your earlier note that you'd revise it.\nSprint-2 authoring session with Emma and Dani\n — confirming whether this is still planned before we lock the Sprint-2 field sets.\nCache and graceful degradation stance\n — your cache/invalidation concern is still open; the doc currently just accepts a bare page render during a full CDA outage.\nOnce we finalize the content, I'll reformat into the prescribed TSD template format.\nThanks!\n\n\n\n\nCC: \n@Jhoan Rose Dela Cruz\n \n@Hazel Marie Cacalda\n ",
